(22,YES,'T22',["Gardening's low-impact nature makes it accessible regardless of age.","Gardening's benefits are confined to physical fitness.","Repetitive gardening tasks tend to heighten anxiety.","Research indicates that only large gardens alleviate depression.","Gardening impairs cognitive function due to its monotony."],
"정답: regardless of : ~에 상관없이 (= people of all ages)\n· be confined to : ~에 국한되다 → 정신 건강(mental health)에도 이로움\n· heighten : 높이다 (↔ reduce)\n· alleviate : 완화하다 (= reduce) → 작은 정원(even a small garden)도 효과\n· impair : 손상시키다 (↔ improve) · cognitive : 인지의 · monotony : 단조로움"),
