(24,YES,'T24',["Some physicians attribute a more significant role to clinical findings than animal researchers acknowledge.","Opponents claim modern medicine is the sole factor behind reduced mortality.","Prosthetic devices are exempt from animal testing under the law.","The physicians' evidence corroborates the defenders' claims.","Opponents believe animal experimentation is legally prohibited."],
"정답: attribute A to B : A를 B의 덕으로 보다 · clinical findings = clinical discoveries · acknowledge : 인정하다\n· sole = only → 반대자들은 '유일한 원인이 아니다'라고 함\n· be exempt from : ~에서 면제되다 → 보철 장치도 동물 실험 대상\n· corroborate : 뒷받침하다 (↔ 실제로는 반박)\n· prohibit : 금지하다 → 실제로는 법이 동물 실험을 요구함"),
